cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below. The data package is
  listed under references.
type: software
title: >-
  caps-ecostress-moyen-atlas: detection of cold-air pools from ECOSTRESS
  nocturnal land surface temperature and terrain morphology
version: 1.0.0
date-released: '2026-10-19'
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/Chahbar-UMI/caps-ecostress-moyen-atlas
url: https://github.com/Chahbar-UMI/caps-ecostress-moyen-atlas
authors:
  - family-names: Chahbar
    given-names: Kamal
    affiliation: Université Moulay Ismail, Laboratoire LGEE, Meknès, Morocco
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0008-3765-2316
keywords:
  - cold-air pooling
  - ECOSTRESS
  - land surface temperature
  - closed depressions
  - topoclimate
  - Middle Atlas
  - Morocco
abstract: >-
  Reproducible Python/Colab pipeline that processes ECOSTRESS L2T LSTE v002
  land surface temperature (70 m) to detect closed depressions acting as
  cold-air traps in the Central Middle Atlas (Morocco): local LST anomaly
  against a 5 km background, morphological reconstruction of closed
  depressions, D8 cold-air flow routing without depression filling, a
  harmonic model of nocturnal inversion development, statistical
  determinants, robustness and between-period stability.
